      "instance_name": "holocaust_gas_chambers",
      "label": "Holocaust Gas Chambers",
      "description": "The phrase 'it really wasn't a shower' refers to the historical deception used by Nazi Germany during the Holocaust, where victims were misled into believing they were entering a shower facility, when in fact they were being sent to gas chambers for mass murder. This is a deeply traumatic and dehumanizing historical event that forms the core of the meme's offensive reference.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
